n\nGodot v4.7.dev5 - macOS Tahoe (26.4.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M3 - Apple M3 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the 4.7-dev5 pre-release, the new Export Template Manager feature allows downloading templates for selected platforms only. However, when a download fails due to a network issue, retrying the download does not resume from where it left off and instead restarts from the beginning.\n\n### Expected Result:\nThe download should resume from the previously downloaded progress (partial download recovery).\n\n### Actual Result:\nThe download restarts from 0% instead of resuming.\n\n### Additional Notes:\nThis behavior can be problematic for large templates or unstable network connections.\nResumable downloads (e.g., via HTTP range requests or partial file caching) would significantly improve reliability and user experience.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the Export Template Manager in Godot `4.7-dev5`.\n2. Select only the iOS export template.\n3. Click `Install Selected Templates` button.\n4. Let the download proceed partially (e.g., ~25%).\n5. Interrupt the network connection or wait for a network error to occur.\n6. Observe the warning icon and hover over it:\n- \"Some files failed to download.\"\n- \"Download failed. Reason: Can't connect to the mirror.\"\n7. Click `Install Selected Templates` button again.\n\n<img width=\"645\" height=\"737\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9dbf1b9-1909-4b19-8b66-ac9da148cea6\" />\n<img width=\"883\" height=\"741\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce79ca6b-bb43-4d95-83f4-b2b045f878f2\" />\n<img width=\"878\" height=\"742\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08e5206a-f597-40cf-95b6-0d715cfb125b\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118795/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118795/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}